      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Size guide",
        "title": "Sizing Charts & Fit Guide",
        "intro": "<p>Tag Safari Clothing for is constructed from durable materials suitable for an active outdoor safari and adventure lifestyle in mind. We Build in plenty of \"Ease\" into our Men's Shirts to ensure you will feel comfortable in every garment. Our Outerwear, Jackets and Vests are always sized to fit over the appropriate layers beneath, ensuring that you do not need to order the next size up. Our Women's shirts and tops have a more tailored flattering fit, while Women's outerwear is appropriately sized to accomodate any base layers worn beneath. Pants and Shorts have ample room for bending and kneeling, making them appropriate to wear on any workday or around the home and garden. We add a little Elastic Stretch into the sides of all Pants and Shorts for both men and women to allow for size flexibility. Hats and Caps are measured above the ears around the circumference of the head in both Inch and Centimeters for a closer fit.</p>",
        "default_unit": "in",
        "units_note": "All measurements are in inches. Sizes vary by brand and manufacturer, so please check the measurements before ordering.",
        "tip_title": "Measuring tip",
        "tip": "<p>When taking measurements with a tailor’s tape, <strong>hold the tape firm and level</strong>. Do not pull it tight.</p>",
        "help_heading": "Need help with sizing?",
        "help_text": "<p>For a perfect fit, our associates are available to answer any questions by chat, call or email. Call us toll free on <a href=\"tel:+18008242703\">1-800-824-2703</a>.</p>",
        "help_button_label": "Contact Us",
        "help_button_link": "shopify://pages/contact"
      }
    },
